    "Steps are tried top to bottom; each step uses all working keys of its provider in order. It moves on after a rate limit (429), a server or network error, a model refusal, or no first token within the timeout.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steps are tried top to bottom; each step uses all working keys of its provider in order. It moves on after a rate limit (429), a server or network error, a model refusal, or no first token within the timeout."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Шаги выполняются сверху вниз; каждый использует рабочие ключи провайдера по очереди. Переход происходит при лимите, ошибке сервера или сети, отказе модели или истечении ожидания первого токена."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
