    "The corrected text is saved in the history (an “edit” event). “Reply again” regenerates the assistant's reply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The corrected text is saved in the history (an “edit” event). “Reply again” regenerates the assistant's reply."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Исправленный текст сохраняется в истории. «Ответить заново» повторно создаёт ответ помощника."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "The journals on this Mac will be deleted. Copies on other devices and in the sync folder remain; the history comes back from the folder at the next sync. Keys and settings are not deleted.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The journals on this Mac will be deleted. Copies on other devices and in the sync folder remain; the history comes back from the folder at the next sync. Keys and settings are not deleted."
          }
        },
        "ru": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Журналы на этом Mac будут удалены. Копии на других устройствах и в папке синхронизации останутся; при следующей синхронизации история вернётся. Ключи и настройки сохранятся."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
